    "created_at": "2016-04-11T10:42:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-11T10:42:47Z",
    "body": "There was evidence that code exists that assumes the presence of navigator.oscpu for Firefox, but I did not see evidence that code exists that assumes the absence of it for non-Firefox. Is there any interest from other vendors to add this for the sake of interop with Firefox?\n",
