    "created_at": "2016-04-11T13:01:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-11T13:01:32Z",
    "body": "I think that's worth considering. In one ad-hoc test in Firefox, `navigator.oscpu` had the same value as `navigator.platform` (\"Linux x86_64\"). Might it work to specify it as a plain alias? If so it'd be very simply to attempt the change in Blink, and very easy to revert in the case of trouble.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
